        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosiclare%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Lead and Fluorspar Mining Company processed ore until 1996, when it closed amid foreign competition.",
